Code taken from the ASP.NET Web Stack lives in src/webForCore.* and test/webForCore.*. Each file
keeps its original copyright header. Files were copied from aspnet/AspNetWebStack commit 2106565
with line endings normalised to CRLF; every other change is listed in LIFT.md, and the per-file
source of each copy is recorded in tools/lift/manifests/.

The assemblies built from that code are delay signed with Microsoft's public key
(src/SigningKey/35MSSharedLib1024.snk, from the ASP.NET Web Stack repository), so that their
identity matches the assemblies Microsoft ships. They are not signed by Microsoft.
